 "description": "<p>A sheer sailor one-piece in white polyester, one size for 40-60 kg, with a bust range of 70-120 cm and waist of 60-90 cm. The sailor elements stay - collar line, cut - while the fabric moves the costume from uniform to lingerie.</p>\n<p>The jumpsuit-with-pants construction is unusual in the sailor category, where skirts dominate. It means no skirt management and a single-line silhouette.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester, sheer</li>\n<li>Item type: one-piece with pants</li>\n<li>Style: sailor</li>\n<li>Color: white</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, bust 70-120 cm, waist 60-90 cm, 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg with the measurements printed. The pants-format sailor option when skirts are not the plan.</p>\n",
